{"id": "t077-059", "text": "me and valentina did the parkrun this morning, she's training for her first marathon in rome on 23rd march. her coach has her on 50 miles a wk already. she's got a dodgy hamstring tho, seeing a physio about it tmrw. her mum and her aunt are flying over to watch. ask val how the physio went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first marathon in rome", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "23rd march", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "coach", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dodgy hamstring", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "seeing a physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tmrw", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask val how the physio went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "val", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t077-060", "text": "valentina's off to buenos aires for xmas to see her nonna. 14hr flight, she's got a fear of turbulence. text her b4 she goes on the 20th", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to buenos aires", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "xmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nonna", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fear of turbulence", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "b4 she goes", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
